{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Character｜初始化流程图\nPawnData、ASC 和各组件何时就绪；类关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_角色与组件.canvas|结构图]]、[[Character/结构|结构文档]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "spawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. GameMode / BossEncounter 生成 Pawn，装入 PawnData。\n\n玩家：GameMode::SpawnSquadMember/SpawnSquadSlot；Boss：BossEncounter::SpawnBoss；对 PawnExtension::SetPawnData(Data)。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "owner",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Slot 或 BossState 先拥有 ASC、基础属性与授予的能力。\n\n调用：Slot::InitializeForPawnData / BossState::InitializeFromDefinition → AbilitySet::GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)。",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bind",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. PawnExtension::InitializeAbilitySystem 把外部 ASC 绑定到当前 Avatar。\n\n调用：CombatantState::AttachAvatar(Pawn) → PawnExtension::InitializeAbilitySystem(ASC, Owner) → ASC::InitAbilityActorInfo。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "init",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. InitState 推进；HealthComponent 绑定 HealthSet，移动层应用 MovementSet。\n\n调用：PawnExtension::CheckDefaultInitialization/HandleChangeInitState → ApplyPawnDataToConsumers；HealthComponent::InitializeWithAbilitySystem。",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "玩家分支：HeroComponent 完成输入绑定、能力重试和相机模式委托。\n\n调用：HeroComponent::InitializePlayerInput → InputComponent::BindNativeAction/BindAbilityActions；绑定 DetermineCameraModeDelegate。",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 878,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "boss",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Boss 分支：AIController 驱动 BT，Pawn 不需要玩家 Hero 输入组件。\n\n调用：BossAIController 驱动 BehaviorTree；BTTask 通过 BossState::GetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent 访问 ASC。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 918,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "unbind",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Avatar 卸载/更换：PawnExtension 清旧绑定；宿主 ASC 生命周期继续。\n\n调用：CombatantState::DetachAvatar(ExpectedPawn) → PawnExtension::UninitializeAbilitySystem；ExpectedPawn 防旧 Pawn 误清新绑定。",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 986,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "spawn",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "owner",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "取得对应宿主"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "owner",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "bind",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "ASC / Owner 已就绪"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "bind",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "init",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Avatar 绑定完成"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "init",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "hero",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "玩家 Pawn"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "init",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "boss",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Boss Pawn"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "bind",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "unbind",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "Avatar 退场"
    }
  ]
}
